tidespell embeds word lists generated from the English Speller Database (ESDB/SCOWL).
Its license and provenance follow, and must accompany any copy of the word lists.
words.txt.gz: size 60, US + GB(-ise), variant level 1, accents kept and stripped, hacker.
tiers.txt.gz: frequency tiers from sizes 35, 40 and 50 (tier = the smallest size containing the word),
US + GB(-ise), variant level 0, accents kept and stripped.

Custom wordlist generated from https://app.aspell.net/create using
the English Speller Database (ESDB) with parameters:
  Size: 60 (default)
  Spelling: US GB(-ise)
  Variant Level: 4 *common*
  Special: hacker
  Diacritics: both

https://wordlist.aspell.net

